# Task: Phase 5 & 6 - Performance Optimization and Advanced Sentiment

## Overview
Implement Phase 5 (Performance Optimization) and Phase 6 (Advanced Sentiment Features) for v1.2.3 to improve NewsEngine scalability and sentiment accuracy.

## Phase 5: Performance Optimization
- [ ] Implement sentiment score caching
  - [ ] Add `@lru_cache` decorator
  - [ ] Configure cache size and expiration
  - [ ] Add cache clear method
- [ ] Vectorize keyword matching
  - [ ] Replace loop-based matching with numpy
  - [ ] Pre-compile regex patterns
  - [ ] Batch process headlines
- [ ] Headline expiration
  - [ ] Filter headlines >7 days old during load
  - [ ] Add headline age check
- [ ] Instrument indexing
  - [ ] Pre-index headlines by instrument
  - [ ] Change storage to Dict[str, DataFrame]
  - [ ] Update query methods for O(1) lookup
- [ ] Lazy loading
  - [ ] Only load data when enabled=True
  - [ ] Add data staleness check
- [ ] Performance testing
  - [ ] Create 1000+ headline test dataset
  - [ ] Benchmark before/after timings
  - [ ] Target: <100ms sentiment queries

## Phase 6: Advanced Sentiment Features
- [ ] Source weighting
  - [ ] Add source column to CSV format
  - [ ] Implement weighted averaging
  - [ ] Configure source weights in config.yaml
- [ ] Sentiment trends
  - [ ] Create get_sentiment_trend() method
  - [ ] Return time-series scores
  - [ ] Detect sentiment shifts
- [ ] NLP-based sentiment (Optional - Deferred)
  - [ ] FinBERT integration
  - [ ] Fallback to keyword matching
  - [ ] Heavy dependencies (transformers, torch)

## Configuration Updates
- [ ] Update config.yaml with new parameters
- [ ] Update NewsConfig dataclass
- [ ] Document new settings

